# Locks the ReadPersonality path (PersonalityFile + Personality combo forms).
# NOTE (characterisation, not aspiration): in the current build a mid-session
# personality load changes only the opening book, not the mid-game eval, so with
# the book off these searches are identical to the default personality. This
# baseline locks that behaviour -- if a refactor changes personality loading, the
# diff catches it.
setoption name Threads value 1
setoption name UseBook value false
setoption name PersonalityFile cloe.txt
position fen r3r1k1/2p2ppp/p1p1bn2/8/1q2P3/2NPQN2/PPP3PP/R4RK1 b - - 2 15
go depth 12
setoption name Personality value tal
go depth 12
quit
